<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Guinness 6-mth net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Guinness 6-mth net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  47.17   vs	  37.29</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 15.6    vs	  12.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   356.47   vs	 338.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    64.74   vs	  51.09</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	10.0    vs	   9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Guinness Anchor Bhd is engaged in the production and distribution of alcoholic beverages.</p>
